  "V+M+S+L", "high", "medium (contested)", "Keep both readings. The doubt belongs to several scholars (Miyazaki Noriko 2005, Qin Xiaolei, discussed and extended by Xu Wenmei), not to Xu alone. The bribery tale is legend and stays off the card.", "None.",
