c("signature", "optional", "H25+H24", "The Artist Left His Name", [2390,2080,2560,2670], [2465,2350],
  "At the very end, in tiny characters down the edge: 'Respectfully made by Qiu Ying, Shifu,' with two small red seals. A Ming-dynasty painter signing a Han-dynasty palace that he imagined more than a thousand years after it stood.",
  "卷末款「仇英實父謹製」，下钤「實父」「仇英」二印。仇英（约1494–1552）为明人，所画为想象中的汉宫。",
  "A vertical line of six small black characters, 仇英實父謹製, followed by two small red seals, beside the large collector seals at the left edge of the silk.",
  [CAT + " — 款識: 仇英實父謹製; 印記: 實父, 仇英", XU + ", p. 38 and Fig. 2"],
  "V+M+S", "high", "high", "Only the two small seals under the signature are Qiu Ying's; the large ones beside them are collectors'.", "Removed from the app at the owner's request, 2026-11-09; kept here as an optional candidate. H24 (Ming painter, Han subject) was folded in here.",
  [25,25,18,10,9,5], "Readable at native size; closes the journey."),

